{"seq":2,"slug":"scientific-outlook-development","title":"科学发展观","stage":"DONE","category":"hu-jintao","categoryLabel":"胡锦涛","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development","rating":{"composite":3.76,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.05,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/05_hu-jintao/2_scientific-outlook-development","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"科学发展观-简介\">科学发展观 简介</h1><p>本知识库是对<strong>科学发展观</strong>这一具体理论命题的专题性深研——从理论框架的建构、内容体系的展开，到实践遗产的评估，提供一条完整的认知路径。科学发展观深刻回答了&quot;实现什么样的发展、怎样发展&quot;这一根本问题，是中国特色社会主义理论体系承前启后的关键一环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工边界\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</h2><p>胡锦涛专题下设五个 hub，本 hub 只聚焦&quot;科学发展观&quot;这一单一理论命题的内部结构，不铺陈生平、不评总账。各 hub 分工如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>2 科学发展观（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>一个理论命题的纵深解剖：命题—内涵—实践</td>\n<td>只讲&quot;发展观&quot;本身的逻辑与落地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1 胡锦涛思想</td>\n<td>思想总览（含科学发展观概述、和谐社会、和平发展）</td>\n<td>提供俯瞰视角；本 hub 是其&quot;科学发展观&quot;节点的放大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 和谐社会</td>\n<td>与科学发展观并列的另一支柱理论</td>\n<td>二者互为姊妹：发展观重&quot;发展&quot;，和谐社会重&quot;分配与秩序&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 胡锦涛传记</td>\n<td>个人经历与政治生涯</td>\n<td>人物史，不涉理论分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5 胡锦涛遗产</td>\n<td>对执政十年的整体总账（成就/争议/定位）</td>\n<td>全局评价；本 hub 只评&quot;发展观&quot;一项的影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：想了解<strong>这一个理论怎么自洽、怎么落地</strong>，读本 hub；想了解<strong>胡锦涛整体执政如何</strong>，读 hub 1 与 hub 5；想理解<strong>与之并列的社会理论</strong>，读 hub 3。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径-分人群\">推荐学习路径（分人群）</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>政治学/马克思主义中国化研究者</strong>：按三章顺序通读——先<a href=\"theoretical-framework/core-proposition\">核心命题</a>与<a href=\"theoretical-framework/first-essence\">发展是第一要义</a>立坐标，再读内容体系三篇把握内涵，最后用实践遗产三篇检验理论的现实解释力。重点关注每篇末尾跨链接里通往邓小平、江泽民、习近平的理论脉络。</li>\n<li><strong>公共政策/经济学读者</strong>：可直奔实践遗产章——<a href=\"practice-legacy/economic-transformation\">经济转型</a>、<a href=\"practice-legacy/social-management\">社会管理创新</a>、<a href=\"practice-legacy/ecological-awareness\">生态文明意识</a>，再回溯第二章内容体系理解其理念根源。</li>\n<li><strong>快速入门读者</strong>：先读 hub 1 的<a href=\"../hu-jintao-thought/core-theories/scientific-outlook-overview\">科学发展观概览</a>建立全局印象，再读本 hub 第一章三篇即可掌握主干。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>中国改革开放以来的经济社会发展基本脉络（建议先了解<a href=\"../../deng-xiaoping-theory/southern-tour-talks/core-speeches/development-is-hard-truth\">发展是硬道理</a>与<a href=\"../../jiang-zemin/jiang-zemin-thought/core-theories/socialist-market-economy\">社会主义市场经济</a>，理解本理论所继承的两个前提）。</li>\n<li>对&quot;五位一体&quot;总体布局、约束性指标等政策术语有基本认识者，阅读会更顺畅。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"theoretical-framework","title":"理论框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/theoretical-framework","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"core-proposition","title":"科学发展观的核心命题","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/theoretical-framework/core-proposition"},{"seq":2,"slug":"first-essence","title":"发展是第一要义","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/theoretical-framework/first-essence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"basic-requirement","title":"全面协调可持续的基本要求","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/theoretical-framework/basic-requirement"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-system","title":"内容体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/content-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"people-oriented","title":"以人为本的发展理念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/content-system/people-oriented"},{"seq":2,"slug":"comprehensive-coordination","title":"全面协调发展","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/content-system/comprehensive-coordination"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sustainable-development","title":"可持续发展理念","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/content-system/sustainable-development"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"practice-legacy","title":"实践遗产","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/practice-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"economic-transformation","title":"科学发展观与经济转型实践","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/practice-legacy/economic-transformation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-management","title":"科学发展观与社会管理创新","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/practice-legacy/social-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ecological-awareness","title":"科学发展观与生态文明意识","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/hu-jintao/scientific-outlook-development/practice-legacy/ecological-awareness"}]}]}